units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Al
mass 1 26.9815
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 1.0 1.0 1.0
run 500000
